SUMMARY:Babies in the Library (birth - 23 months)
DESCRIPTION:Babies meet babies! Parents and caregivers sing nursery rhymes 
 together with their little ones. Songs\, language activities\, and board 
 books will be introduced during each session. Make baby's first library 
 experience a special one! No registration required\, space is limited.
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Storytime Room\, Montclair Public Library
