SUMMARY:Crafting Memorable Characters for Memoir and Fiction NEW
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nVivid characters are the lifeblood of good fiction and memoir. 
 We’ll focus on exercises that add dimension and complexity to our 
 “people on the page.” \n\nAll writing is done in class but 30 minutes 
 of reading between sessions is requested (sent a few days in advance).\n
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Conference Room\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Adult School":MAILTO:adultschool@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult School, Writing
