SUMMARY:Girl Talk -Online Zoom Event -Dating Questions
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nThis even
 t is for females only\, All ages are welcomed.\n\nI asked Chat GPT some go
 od Girl Talk questions and we will be taking turns answering them. We will
  go through as many questions as we can in the limited time.\n\nChat GPT s
 ays:\n\n### Easy & Fun\n\n* What’s your ideal weekend with someone you l
 ike?\n* What’s your biggest dating green flag?\n* What’s a small thing
  someone can do that instantly makes you like them?\n* Are you more of a t
 exter\, caller\, or FaceTime person?\n* What’s your favorite kind of com
 pliment to receive?\n* What’s your love language?\n* What fictional coup
 le do you love?\n* What’s your dream date idea?\n* What’s something th
 at always makes you laugh?\n* Would you rather have a super romantic partn
 er or a super funny one?\n\n### Personality & Compatibility\n\n* What qual
 ities matter most to you in a relationship?\n* What’s something you valu
 e in friendships *and* relationships?\n* Do you believe opposites attract?
 \n* What kind of personality are you usually drawn to?\n* What’s somethi
 ng you’ve learned about yourself while being single?\n* What’s one non
 -negotiable for you in dating?\n* What helps you feel comfortable around n
 ew people?\n* What makes someone memorable to you?\n* Are you more introve
 rted or extroverted when you like someone?\n* What’s your communication 
 style in relationships?\n\n### Cute & Slightly Flirty\n\n* What’s your b
 iggest harmless crush right now?\n* What’s the cutest thing someone coul
 d do for you?\n* What kind of first impression usually catches your attent
 ion?\n* What’s your favorite thing about getting to know someone new?\n*
  What’s your ideal meet-cute?\n* Do you fall fast or take your time?\n* 
 What’s your favorite thing about being single?\n* What’s something swe
 et someone has done for you?\n* What’s your type — personality-wise?\n
 * What’s your idea of romance?\n\n### Deeper but Still Comfortable\n\n* 
 What does a healthy relationship look like to you?\n* What kind of support
  means the most to you?\n* What’s something you appreciate more as you g
 et older?\n* What makes you feel genuinely understood?\n* What’s somethi
 ng you hope for in your future relationship?\n* What values are important 
 to you in a partner?\n* What’s something you admire in confident people?
 \n* What kind of energy do you bring into relationships?\n* What helps bui
 ld trust for you?\n* What’s one thing you think people misunderstand abo
 ut dating today?\n\n### Group Conversation Questions\n\n* Who’s most lik
 ely to accidentally fall in love first?\n* What’s everyone’s biggest g
 reen flag?\n* What’s the best relationship advice you’ve heard?\n* Wha
 t’s a dating trend you don’t understand?\n* What’s one thing people 
 should normalize in dating?\n* What’s your most wholesome crush story?\n
 * What’s the nicest compliment you’ve ever gotten?\n* What’s somethi
 ng attractive that has nothing to do with looks?\n* What’s everyone’s 
 dream vacation with a partner?\n* What’s a movie relationship you think 
 is actually healthy?
