SUMMARY:[NEW DATE] Masters of Modern Design and Architecture: Ray and Charles Eames NEW
DESCRIPTION:This is a paid Adult School class. Click here to 
 register.\n\nNo stylish midcentury modern home was complete without the 
 iconic leather-and-plywood Eames lounge chair\, but Charles and Ray Eames 
 accomplished so much more. We can hardly overstate the influence of this 
 immensely talented husband-and-wife team on architecture\, industrial 
 design\, graphics\, manufacturing\, and photography from the 1940s through 
 the 1970s. Without Charles and Ray Eames\, modernism as we know it would 
 hardly be the same. Explore their extraordinary body of work with Laszlo 
 Kiss\, an architect and interior designer.
LOCATION:Montclair Main - Conference Room\, Montclair Public Library
ORGANIZER;CN="Montclair Adult School":MAILTO:adultschool@montclairlibrary.org
CATEGORIES:Adult School
