DESCRIPTION:<p><span>The Green Team Ministry invites you to experience wor
 ship in an outdoor setting through readings\, sharing\, music\, &amp\; int
 ervals of deep silence. FCC member\, Derek Polzer\, will lead this spiritu
 al activity. For those who would like to stay after the service\, we will 
 have a (bring your own) picnic lunch together at 11:30. </span></p><p><sp
 an><u><strong>Location:</strong></u> Porter Park\, 12 Harrison Avenue\, M
 ontclair.</span></p><p><span><u><strong>Notes:</strong></u> </span></p><p>
 <span>*Bring your own folding chair</span></p><p><span>*There are no restr
 oom facilities at Porter Park<br>*Dogs on leashes are welcome</span></p><p
