 an>click here to register and RSVP.</span> </a><span>You will be contacted
  if the event is cancelled or rescheduled due to inclement weather. <em>Ra
 in date is Saturday\, June 6.</em><br>Please email </span><a href="mailto:
 greenteam@fccmtc.com"><span>greenteam@fccmtc.com</span></a><span> with any
  questions. </span></p>
