SUMMARY:V for Volleyball at Overpeck Park
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nI'm Mike 
 and my son is Michael. Join us as we play for fun initially\, then we'll b
 reak up into teams. When we make teams\, we'll get a bit competitive where
  you must serve to score! Games will be to 25 or 15 if we have more people
  playing.\nOutdoor hard court. No kicking\, no using your head.\nWe may be
  going to Tropical Juice Bar afterwards at 60 River St. in Hackensack or s
 omewhere for food/drinks.\nThere's no fee to play\, maybe bring a ball. We
 'll have 2 Mikasa balls & 1 Wilson ball.\nIt's not on 41 Willow Tree Road\
 , Leonia\, NJ.\nThe court is open to the public and if it happens to be ta
 ken\, we may play with those already playing it or we will move to the gra
 ss since we have our own Volleyball NET!\nIf it's looking like it'll rain\
 , I'll make a call on whether to cancel.\nIf you have fun and would like t
 o play with us at other locations\, join us!\n[V for Volleyball New Jersey
  | Facebook](https://www.facebook.com/groups/1587314685975434)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/314570693/
