SUMMARY:Summer Bar Crawl - North Jersey
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nCome join
  the group for a Summer Kick-Off Bar Crawl in Hoboken.\n\nWe'll be startin
 g earlier than usual and in the middle of Washington Street\, rather than 
 up in the northern part of town.\n\nWe'll tentatively plan to start at Bla
 ck Bear Hoboken Bar & Grill\, 205 Washington St.\, and then walk around fr
 om there. Official schedule is TBD for now.\n\nOf course\, join us at any 
 time. We'll try to post updates in the comments as the night unfolds. Feel
  free to call or text Andy Milone at 201-234-9609\, or direct message him 
 on Meetup or on Whatsapp\, if you can't find us or have questions.\n\nIt's
  totally optional to consume a few adult beverages. Feel free to just come
  and have a good time hanging out.\n\nPlease be smart about travel. The tr
 ain station is not far away and runs late. Parking can be a challenge\, bu
 t there is street parking (where residential permit is not required)\, and
  several paid public parking garages\, including at 112 River St. and 1330
  Willow Ave. Feel free to comment below if interested in carpooling.\n\nTh
 is event follows our St. Patrick's Day\, Halloween and Holiday bar crawls\
 , a trend spurred by Ray and Raymond\, two regular attendees of our events
 .\n\nQuestions? Suggestions? Concerns? You can reach out to Andy Milone at
  201-234-9609 (call/text)\, or by message over Meetup or Whatsapp.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/314611243/
