SUMMARY:2nd Annual Bob Marley Celebration of Life
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the rich musical legacy of Bob Marley with us on Saturday\, 5/30\, from 5:30-10pm! \nEnjoy entry to our unique Bob Marley’s Celebration of Life festival!\nThe $30 General Ticket includes live music by a big band from 7-10pm performing all of Bob Marley’s greatest hits\, plus a curated Caribbean playlist from 5:30-7pm\, fresh expertly prepared Caribbean food available for purchase by Taste of the Caribbean\, games like Ludi\, Dominoes\, card games available for all to play\, and much more!\nThe $50 VIP Ticket includes everything the General Ticket comes with and also reserved seating under our fully covered gazebos and dedicated servers delivering your order. Please note\, everyone within the gazebos will need a VIP ticket\, children included.\nThe $20 Child Ticket includes everything the General Ticket comes with but at a reduced price for those underaged. Please note that a Child Ticket will grant children entry to the Beer Garden within the General Admission area. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/2nd-annual-bob-marley-celebration-of-life/
