DESCRIPTION:In this hands-on workshop\, you will discover how to craft a stunning corsage from scratch. Whether you’re preparing for a special event or simply want to master a new creative skill\, we will guide you through the process of selecting\, securing\, and styling blooms for maximum impact. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
