X-SOURCE:Montclair State University
CATEGORIES:Athletics
DESCRIPTION:\n\nInstructor-led strength and conditioning class designed to
  hit every major muscle group in just 30 minutes. Using a combination of 
 compound lifts\, bodyweight movements\, and targeted conditioning work\, 
 each session is programmed to build real strength and leave you energized
  for the rest of the day. Instructors scale every movement so you work at
  the right intensity for your level.\nHow do I Sign-up?\n\nRegistration i
