SUMMARY:Meeting at the Verona inn!
DESCRIPTION:Board Game Night At Verona Inn\nWe will be doing our first mon
 thly meeting starting on **February 25th at the Verona Inn!** We will be m
 eeting up to organize games starting at 7:30\, with food and drinks availa
 ble courtesy of our host! You can play any game provided by hosts or bring
  your own! If you do not have a friend group to play games\, hosts will or
 ganize you into pods with other people who need players. There are **no du
 es**. Future meetings will be held on the **last Wednesday of each month.*
 *\n\nMore information and ground rules:\n\n***The doors open at 4:30 but g
 ames do not start until 5:00. **I *highly recommend* coming in during this
  period to eat your food and drink ahead of time!\n** *Please return the g
 raciousness provided by our hosts and order at least one item! All venue s
 pecific rules apply to our club. **Future meetings depend on treating our 
 hosts with respect.\n*** All games must be returned to their owners when t
 hey announce that they are leaving. **If you are in a game in progress whe
 n the meeting ends but it is not borrowed you may continue playing!\n** *P
 lease place food and drink on a separate table or surface from your games 
 **to help avoid stains and other damage.***\n*** Please engage with others
  in good faith\, sportsmanship\, respect and common sense. ABSOLUTELY NO h
 arassment\, getting physical\, hurtful insulting\, and persecutory languag
 e will be tolerated. *Repeat violators of venue rules AND/OR this rule may
  be asked to leave the event and not return.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/board-game-night-at-verona-inn/events
 /313287582/
