 ss the street from the Millburn Free Public Library\nDistance: 4-5 miles\,
  Intermediate Level Must be able to walk 2.2 mph in order to meet the sche
 duled time.\n\nJoin South Mountain Conservancy Hike Leader Donna Burkat fo
 r a moderately paced hike with hills.\n\n**Meet at:** Locust Grove parking
  area (Also known as Fairy Trail area)\n\n**Leader**: Donna Burkat- 973-45
 4-5635 call or text if you need to cancel.\n\n\\*\\*\\* In registering for
