DESCRIPTION:\n\n\n\n1) Please have your Event Pass\, Student ID\, CWID and
  have a PantrySoft Registration. 2) Please bring your own shopping bag!**
 *Visitors are allowed to come once/week***\nOur Mission:  We aim to addre
 ss food insecurity across Montclair State University. The Red Hawk Pantry
