DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260612T091500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260612T101500
SUMMARY:Eagle Rock Reservation
DESCRIPTION:Let's Walk!!\nJOIN US FOR A WALK. WE WALK AT A MODERATE PACE O
 N UNPAVED PATHS.\n\nWe will hike for about an hour - 3.5 miles. We will be
  walking on trails in the woods\, so appropriate footwear\, long pants & s
 ocks\, and bug spray.\n\nWill will meet at:\n[https://goo.gl/maps/7rRRTiXC
 ntdE1neD7](https://goo.gl/maps/7rRRTiXCntdE1neD7) Eagle Rock Trail Parking
  Lot by Kiosk#1\n\nIf you enter from Eagle Rock Way\, go pass the Highlawn
  and stay left. There will be a parking lot at the end of the curve to you
 r right.\n\nEagle Rock Reservation is 408 acres of hills\, streams\, and v
 alleys located on the borders of West Orange\, Verona\, and Montclair\, Ne
 w Jersey. Though located in the middle of the most densely populated count
 y in the most densely populated state in the country\, the Reservation is 
 mostly undeveloped and boasts an extensive trail system within its borders
 .\n\n**Please make sure to RSVP and arrive 5 minutes prior to start time.*
 *\n\nFOLLOW US ON INSTAGRAM - letswalkmeetup\n\nDisclaimer: If you join us
  for a hike\, please understand that you are responsible for your own prep
 aredness and well-being and will hold no one else liable in case of injury
  or mishap. Event will be canceled in the event of extreme weather.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lets-walkprogram/events/314585712/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260501T222439Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260501T222439Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Montclairfoundation Calendar Of Events": "https://montclairfoundation.org/event/the-secret-tea-room-at-van-vleck-9-2/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:montclairfoundation_calendar_of_events
X-SOURCE:Montclair Foundation
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260612T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260612T160000
DTSTAMP:20260527T003019
CREATED:20260212T223414Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260515T194153Z
UID:10006753-1781263800-1781280000@montclairfoundation.org
SUMMARY:The Secret Tea Room at Van Vleck
DESCRIPTION:Seating times: \n11:30 – 1\n12:00 -1:30\n1 – 2:30\n\n\nJoin us for an enchanting Cream Tea in the House Living Room at Van Vleck House & Gardens! \nUpon arrival\, you will be offered a menu of fine teas and infusions. Your choice of tea will be brewed to perfection. Once everyone is settled in\, the tiers will arrive with freshly baked scones\, jam\, homemade clotted cream\, scrumptious sandwiches\, and a dessert. We hope you will join us! \nThis event is for adults and children ages 13+. Seatings are 90 minutes\, and registration is required. \nDietary Restrictions\nA gluten-free option is available with prior notice. We are not able to accommodate a dairy-free or vegan diet. All requests must be communicated to us 48 hours before the event. You may note this request on the checkout page. \nPlease note that this event is a fundraiser\, and a portion of your ticket price will go towards supporting our beloved Van Vleck House & Gardens. \nMember Price: $45\nGeneral Price: $55\nA 10% gratuity for your server is included in tea pricing. \n\n\n \nPlease note: if you are trying to purchase more tickets than remain in the timeslot\, the ticket process will not complete your order and will give an error code.
URL:https://montclairfoundation.org/event/the-secret-tea-room-at-van-vleck-9-2/
LOCATION:Van Vleck House & Gardens\, 21 Van Vleck Street\, Montclair\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Events,Adults
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://montclairfoundation.org/content/uploads/2025/12/20250606_115910-1-scaled-e1770935621557.jpg
END:VEVENT
