UID:event_314610727@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260527T043016Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260613T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260613T170000
SUMMARY:NJ Code & Coffee - June meetup
DESCRIPTION:NJ Code & Coffee\nCalling all New Jersey techies to the monthl
 y **NJ Code and Coffee** tech community meetup at the EqualSpace ES550 Tec
 h & Innovation campus!\n\nCode and Coffee is an inclusive\, informal netwo
 rking/co-working session for those in tech (and the tech-curious).\nThat i
 ncludes operators\, founders\, and investors. Developers\, data engineers\
 , UX/UI designers\, data scientists\, product managers\, software engineer
 s\, solution architects... **all are welcome!**\n\nPeople of all skill and
  experience levels can attend\, we love it that way. Many people (optional
 ly) bring projects to work on\, and many other people (optionally) sociali
 ze the entire time. It's entirely up to you!\n\nCome grab a cup of coffee 
 and meet new people\, share stories\, find collaborators\, talk about ever
 ything tech\, talk about everything NOT tech\, take a break from job appli
 cations\, get away from the computer screen\, make connections\, make conv
 ersation\, **make friends!**\n\n**Agenda:**\n**2pm:** Doors open\, network
 ing starts\n**2:30pm:** Intro circle\n**3pm:** networking continues\n**5pm
 :** event ends\n\n**The Intro Circle**\n**Near the beginning of the event 
 (about 2:30 pm)\, we will do a standup in a circle:**\nWe first talk about
  organizer announcements\, updates\, and logistics. Then we go around the 
 circle where each person says:\n\n\\*your name and job title/ role in tech
 / tech stack\,\n\n* What you can help others with\,\n\\*What you would lik
 e help with\,\n* Job opportunities you're hiring for OR announce that you 
 are looking for one. If none\, that's cool.\n\nAfter the introduction circ
 le\, everything is self-organized.\n\n**Community Discord - come hang out 
 before and after!:**\n[www.codeandcoffee.chat](www.codeandcoffee.chat)\n\n
 **The Venue**\nEqual Space is a premium share-space created with multicult
 ural business owners in mind\, =SPACE equips founders with resources\, pro
 gramming and a powerful network.\n\nHeadquartered in the City of Newark\, 
 their share-space provides resources for startups\, coaching for tech comp
 anies\, and a wealth of intellectuals to collaborate and build with. The n
 ext wave in enterprises is being born within their walls. Become a part of
  the story: [EqualSpace.co/](https://equalspace.co/)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/nj-code-coffee/events/314610727/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260503T150327Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260503T150327Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
