DESCRIPTION:4:00pm - Congregational Meeting in the Sanctuary   \n5:00pm - 
 BBQ in the Social Hall   \n  \nJoin us at Shomrei's end-of-the-year commun
 ity appreciation barbecue. Bring your family and cast your vote on an impo
 rtant new constitutional amendment.  \n  \n**BBQ**: RSVP required so we kn
 ow how much food to buy.   \n**Babysitting**: Will be available during the
  meeting (from 4-5PM). Children must remain in their babysitting location 
 until picked up by a parent or guardian. Please RSVP so we have the proper
  number of sitters.  \nRSVP_for_BBQ_&amp\;_Babysitting: https://shomrei.ea
 syshul.com/events/6a03739815c7290027d2bc7e  \n  \n**Annual Meeting Highlig
 hts:**   \n1\\. President's update  \n2\\. Introduction and vote on the ne
 w board slate   \n3\\. Presentation on strategic framework   \n4\\. Budget
  presentation   \n  \nThe Annual Meeting of the Cemetery Association will 
 take place immediately following the Congregational Meeting.\n\n
