 ch session is programmed to build real strength and leave you energized f
 or the rest of the day. Instructors scale every movement so you work at t
 he right intensity for your level.\nHow do I Sign-up?\n\nRegistration is 
 not required.\nFREE for students with a valid Montclair State ID\n\nWhere
